<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAVYD"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Desert LAndscape - Evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The sun hangs low in the sky, easing off the blessed heat that’s baked the earth so dry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Stillness.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Suddenly, SHUFFLING FEET break the silence and alert birds to flee from their perch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A figure reveals himself rounding the bend. It’s DAVYD.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Davyd</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So hot. So, so hot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd reaches to unbutton the top button of his signature WHITE SHIRT. A lavalliere microphone still hangs from the fabric.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Faint VOICES chime on the wind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>All of Taylor Swift’s music suddenly vanished over night.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd shuffles forward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVYD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So thirsty...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>All that remains is a message that says “Meet at the White Horse Ranch in the Arizona desert.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd falls to his knees. Panting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>With us now is Davyd, a man who took the pilgrimage to Arizona to live with and follow the teachings of Taylor Swift.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DaVYD (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Her name is Mother Swift now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Davyd</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Can’t go on... So far...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd claws forward, grasping at boulders.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Taylor Swift’s reach has become inescapable. She’s recently kidnapped prominent </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">NoHo</Text>
      <Text> socialite, Topanga Canyon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVYD (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Taylor Swift doesn’t kidnap anybody! I do! For HER!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd presses on, each grasp slower and more labored than the last.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He pauses and looks up, taking in his surroundings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Davyd</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So this is where it all ends...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He grasps forward with one last herculean claw forward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVYD (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes! Yes I decided to cut my balls off. I’m castrated for HER!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd has reached an impassible cliff. He looks out at the view, it’s beautiful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He laughs to himself, and drops his head to the ground. Exhausted. Defeated.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DAVYD (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Tell my parents I love them! But don’t tell them about my balls!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Suddenly, the crunch of footsteps alert Davyd, his eyes roll back into focus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The feet come to a stop inches from Davyd’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A chilled BOTTLE OF WATER drops right in front of Davyd’s nose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (o.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I kept your secret, Davyd.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd reaches out for the water and slowly sits up. He can only make out a silhouette of a man towering above him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We never told your parents about your balls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd guzzles water from the bottle, as ALEC reaches his hand down to help Davyd up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd grabs Alec’s hand and rises as they both look out past the cliff’s edge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec strikes a triumphant pose standing tall with his hands on his hips.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We’re going back for Topanga.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Davyd</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>NOW?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Davyd drops his arms in defeat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SMASH TO BLACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>TITLE CARD: THE NOHO RAG</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>TITLE CARD: NEW EPISODES THIS APRIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

